## 📌 Conclusion

This project demonstrates an end-to-end machine learning workflow for phishing URL classification, from feature extraction and model training to deployment using Snowflake Streamlit.

The project provides an interactive application where users can enter a URL and receive a machine learning-based classification along with probability and extracted feature information.
